          "path": [
            "適應症"
          ],
          "content_text": "巴拉松(Parathion)甲基巴拉松(Methyl Parathion)等有機磷劑,農藥中毒之解毒劑。",
          "content_html": "<p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體;\">巴拉松</span>(Parathion)<span style=\"font-family:標楷體;\">甲基巴拉松</span>(Methyl Parathion)<span style=\"font-family:標楷體;\">等有機磷劑</span>,<span style=\"font-family:標楷體;\">農藥中毒之解毒劑。</span></p>",
          "search_text": "2\n適應症\n巴拉松(Parathion)甲基巴拉松(Methyl Parathion)等有機磷劑,農藥中毒之解毒劑。",
